# Private working context — deliberately NOT published.
#
# These are the notebook and the multi-agent coordination workspace: raw ideas,
# candid session logs, internal handoff notes. Nothing secret, but they are
# unfiltered working notes and they name the human. They stay on disk and out
# of git. Contributor-facing rules live in CONTRIBUTING.md instead.
#
# Git history is permanent — if any of this is ever committed, gitignoring it
# afterwards does nothing. Keep it out from the first commit.
.apsolut/
.apsolut-agents/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
HANDOFF.md

# Derived from Anthropic's cli binary — regenerable with tools/prettify.sh.
# Git history is permanent, so these stay out of it: ~47MB, and none of it is
# ours to redistribute.
tools/cli.pretty.js
tools/system-prompts-*/

# install.ps1 backups. These existed only because the file used to live under
# gitignored .apsolut/07-files/ and had no version control. Git is the backup
# now — delete them once the first commit lands.
install.ps1.*-bak
